.BR fish\-tutorial (1) ,
.BR fish\-faq (1) ,
.BR fish\-for\-bash\-users (1) ,
.BR fish\-interactive (1) ,
.BR fish\-language (1) ,
.BR fish_indent (1) ,
.BR fish_key_reader (1)
.sp
مستندات وب کامل: <https://fishshell.com/docs/current>
